2025-08-16T09:25:45.880Z [Read and Write Apple Notes] [info] Message from server: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<div><h1>7c </h1></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Kunsthalle </div>\n<div>Atlantis</div>\n<div>Kino</div>\n<div>Döner essen</div>\n<div>Stadtgallerie? </div>\n<div>Stadtbücherei Würzburg </div>\n<div>Geiselwind</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Wen kann man von Verwandten Freunden in die Schule einladen? Wie? </div>"}]},"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":28} { metadata: undefined }
